title: Authorizations › Case page › Header and buttons
route: /authorizations/case/R-1042
intro: The header card above the three tiles: the title and its chips, the line that names the patient, the 'Next' block, the authorization facts and the 'At a glance' lines. It stays the same on all five tabs, and it follows the request: once the request is sent or decided the header shows its new status. The next action is drawn in 21, the facts in 27, and the three tiles and the one-line notice in 23.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: the header reads the request's current stage from the Dashboard, so signing and sending in New Case, or a payer reply made with the Dashboard demo controls, shows here at once.
---
screen pg "Case page\nCrumbs, header card, three tiles, one-line notice, five tabs, History"
click cr "Click the 'Authorizations' crumb"
goto gQ "Continues in: Authorizations › Queue › Open the queue and read the top"

screen hd "Header title\nLevel chip, ID, request type chip, then one pill"
decision dCh "Has the request been sent, decided or settled since this page was written, or does it already have a result?"
toast pc "Pill shows the request's current status, e.g. 'Received', 'Approved'\nAn info icon beside it opens 'What the statuses mean'"
process pd "Pill shows the due text, e.g. 'Notice due in 5 h'\nRed under 6 h, amber under 24 h, grey later"
process sub "Sub line: 'J.M., 34 · Summit Medicaid HMO · Residential 3.5 · 14 days requested'\nIOP counts units: '21 units requested'\nA viewer who can see both sites also gets a quiet '· Site A' at the end\nA viewer with one site does not"
screen nb "'Next:' block, the first thing under the title\nThe next action and one primary button"
goto gN "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › Next action"
screen fr "Authorization facts row\nOnly the facts this request has"
goto gF "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › Authorization facts"

group gAg "'At a glance' (one short block)"
  process ag0 "'At a glance' line\nThe diagnosis and review type, then the scores with a trend arrow\n'AUDIT-C 11 · PHQ-9 17 ↑ · CIWA 14 → 4'"
  decision dRd "Ready: all four checks pass and still preparing?"
  agent ag1 "Integrity badge\n'Ready to sign. Integrity passed all four checks'"
  agent ag3 "The request's own agent and line\ne.g. Navigator: 'Navigator checks again in 30 minutes'"
  agent ag2 "Agent badge and status line\ne.g. Scribe: 'Scribe is drafting the case'"
  decision dRule "Does the queue have a payer note for it?"
  process rule "Green line 'Payer note: Summit expects a named step-down provider with the first request.'"
endgroup
decision dDb "Is the request on the Dashboard past Preparing, and is the next action not already the Dashboard?"
click od "Click 'Open on the Dashboard' (next to the status line)"
goto gDb "Continues in: Dashboard › Request drawer › Open and read a request"

group gBt "Header buttons"
  click b1 "Click 'Open in review and sign'\n(always on)"
  click b3 "Click 'Back to queue'"
endgroup
goto gS "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › Send to payer and review and sign"
goto gT "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › Numbers and notes"

pg --> cr --> gQ
pg --> hd --> dCh
dCh -->|Yes| pc
dCh -->|No| pd
pc --> sub
pd --> sub
sub --> nb --> gN
nb --> fr --> gF
fr --> ag0 --> dRd
dRd -->|Yes| ag1
dRd -->|No| ag2
dCh -.->|Yes| ag3
ag1 --> dRule
ag2 --> dRule
ag3 --> dRule
dRule -->|Yes| rule
dRule -->|No| dDb
rule --> dDb
dDb -->|Yes| od --> gDb
pg --> b1 --> gS
pg --> b3 --> gQ
pg --> gT
